  "story": {
    "day": 64,
    "title": "A Postcard from the Past",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya studied social studies in the kitchen because she was very hungry.",
      "She wanted to get some sweet candy from her case.",
      "Under the desk, she found a plastic ruler and a postcard.",
      "\"Hey, whose postcard is this?\" Kaya asked.",
      "\"It is mine,\" her grandfather said.",
      "He visited the beautiful blue sea in Asia long ago.",
      "He does not live in California now, but he loved it.",
      "He sent this card from there with warm regards.",
      "Next, Kaya wondered how to have a lot of fun.",
      "First, she tried a sport like badminton, and then joined the music club.",
      "Maybe she could meet many friends at the best school festival."
    ]
  }
}